    <!-- Mesh Guide -->
    <string name="mesh_guide_text">
        <b>Bluetooth Mesh Protocol Guide:</b><br/><br/>
        <b>1. Connectionless Mesh Flooding / Beacons:</b><br/>
        You do <b>NOT</b> need to connect to any device to receive or send alerts! Alerts are broadcasted directly into the air via BLE Advertising packets. Any device running the background service will detect and display the alert.<br/><br/>
        <b>2. Mesh Proxy Service (0x1828):</b><br/>
        Allows 1-to-1 point-to-point GATT streaming and proxy filtering.<br/><br/>
        <b>3. Background Operation:</b><br/>
        The app runs a foreground connected device service with CPU wakelock support to continuously scan and receive alerts even when the device is locked.
    </string>
